    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0301" n="209" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg209"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119So/9</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-11T13:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 11, 1918, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 12, 11.31
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1513. My telegram 1488, March 26, 3 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d144-f1"/> Minister
                    for Foreign Affairs has mentioned to me again the good effect it would have to
                    be able to refer in Parliament to our view touching subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
